#. CoST IDS element
#: mapping/reactive-process-level-implementation.csv:1
msgid "List of variations, changes, amendments"
msgstr "Lista de variaciones, cambios, enmiendas"

#. Description
#: mapping/reactive-process-level-implementation.csv:1
msgid ""
"Details of changes to the duration, price, scope or other significant "
"features of the contracting process"
msgstr ""
"Detalles de cambios en la  duración, el precio, el alcance u otras "
"características significativas del proceso de contratación."

#. Mapping to OC4IDS
#: mapping/reactive-process-level-implementation.csv:1
msgid ""
"For each variation, change or amendment, publish an entry with a `.date` "
"and `.description` in `.summary.modifications`.\n"
"\n"
"Set `.type` based on the type of change and provide the relevant "
"before/after values in `.oldContractPeriod`, `.oldContractValue`, "
"`.newContractPeriod` and `.newContractValue`."
msgstr ""

#. Mapping from OCDS
#: mapping/reactive-process-level-implementation.csv:1
msgid ""
"*Monitor the following fields for changes:*\n"
"\n"
"* `/contracts/value`\n"
"* `/contracts/period`\n"
"* `/contracts/description`\n"
"* `/contracts/items`\n"
"* `/contracts/implementation/milestones`\n"
"\n"
"*Copy `/contracts/amendments/description` to "
"`summary.modifications.description` and `/date` to "
"`.summary.modifications.date`.*"
msgstr ""

